[00:03.721]   
[00:03.721]Life blooms like a flower
[00:07.017]生命如花朵绽放
[00:07.017]Far away or by the road
[00:10.578]或许遥远，或许就在路边
[00:10.578]Waiting for the one
[00:13.868]等待着那个人
[00:13.868]To find the way back home
[00:17.532]找到回家的路
[00:17.532]Rain falls a thousand times
[00:21.092]雨水数千次的冲刷
[00:21.092]No footprints of come-and-go
[00:24.682]已经分辨不清来往的脚印
[00:24.682]You who once went by
[00:28.292]曾经过此处的你
[00:28.292]Where will you belong
[00:30.672]终将属于哪里
[00:30.672]I feel your sigh and breath
[00:33.995]我察觉到你的叹息与呼吸
[00:33.995]In the last blow of wind
[00:38.438]在风最后的呼啸之中
[00:38.438]Not yet for the story on the last page
[00:42.679]还未到将故事翻至末页的时候
[00:42.679]It's not the end
[00:46.023]所以一切还未结束
[00:46.023]Life blooms like a flower
[00:49.291]生命如花朵绽放
[00:49.291]Far away or by the road
[00:52.869]遥不可及，或触手可得
[00:52.869]Waiting for the one
[00:56.179]等待着那个人
[00:56.179]To find the way back home
[00:59.965]找到回家的路
[00:59.965]Time flows across the world
[01:03.447]时光流淌过天地间
[01:03.447]There is always a longer way to go
[01:08.033]我的旅程不会结束
[01:08.033]Till I reach your arms
[01:10.375]直至能与你相拥
[01:10.375]A Madder there for you
[01:14.390]并献上一株茜草
[01:14.390]Up against the stream
[01:17.652]沿着溪流向上
[01:17.652]Waterways will join as one
[01:21.176]无数水流终将合一
[01:21.176]Tracing to the source
[01:24.677]追溯着源头
[01:24.677]No more strayed or lost
[01:27.070]便可不再迷惘
[01:27.070]You will see petals fly
[01:30.422]你将看见花瓣纷飞
[01:30.422]When lament becomes carol
[01:34.899]当悲伤之音转而歌颂
[01:34.899]Could you please hear my voice
[01:37.466]请你听见我的声音
[01:37.466]That hungers for a duo
[01:42.372]正渴望与你二重唱
